| !Boot file for !WimpLib, the library of JavaScript modules that
| programs import as 'wimplib/<Name>'. The desktop runs it at
| start-up, as it does every application in !Boot.Resources, so the
| library is known before any program needs it.
| A setting made before this runs is kept: set WimpLib$Dir (or
| WimpLib$Path) first to use another copy of the library.
IconSprites <Obey$Dir>.!Sprites
If "<WimpLib$Dir>" = "" Then Set WimpLib$Dir <Obey$Dir>
If "<WimpLib$Path>" = "" Then Set WimpLib$Path <WimpLib$Dir>.
Set WimpLib$Version 1.00
